WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:10.690
Water quality in the Bohuslän archipelago. A single Sentinel-2 pass captures patterns across Stigfjorden and the nearby coastal waters.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:20.130
MDN and C2RCC infer chlorophyll-a concentration using different retrieval methods.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:27.490
Differences between methods help identify where further validation is especially useful.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:38.050
Bottom reflection and optical water type can distort estimates. These maps do not identify toxicity or algal species.
